1. gh-notch (MIT License)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/aymandakirgh/ghnotch
Adapted components:
- Pure notch panel state machine logic (renamed and integrated as
  liquiddinamo/Features/Motion/LiquidNotchStateMachine.swift)
- Pure multi-display panel target selection logic (renamed and integrated as
  liquiddinamo/Features/Motion/LiquidDisplaySelection.swift)
- Sandbox-safe Now Playing backend eligibility and elapsed-time interpolation
  logic (renamed and integrated into
  liquiddinamo/MediaControllers/NowPlayingCore.swift and
  liquiddinamo/MediaControllers/NowPlayingController.swift)
- Pure HUD key decoding, segment/glow formatting, and consecutive-failure
  intercept safety logic (renamed and integrated as
  liquiddinamo/Features/Motion/HUDLogicCore.swift)
- Pure bounded file-shelf insertion, deduplication, move-to-front, and eviction
  list transforms (renamed and integrated into
  liquiddinamo/components/Shelf/Models/ShelfCore.swift)

